## App Integration

The meshtastic App
- D10 is Vibration motor
- D4 is button
- SHT20 tempererature sensor

The **SwiftUI BLE App** for iOS offers:
- Real-time control of LEDs and vibration
- BLE command buttons
- Notification-to-action mapping (e.g., WhatsApp = `BUZZ`)
- JSON-formatted sensor data streaming
- Optional REST API hook to external AI engines

